+-------------------------------------------------------------|
|              Layout de Importacao PID/DSK - MIBO            |
|-------------------------------------------------------------|
|                       Formato: Excel                        |
|-------------------------------------------------------------|
| Ordem |  Descricao       |  Coluna | Conteudo | Obrigatorio | 
|-------+------------------+---------+----------+-------------|
|   1   |  PO              |    01   | Inteiro  |     SIM     |
|   2   |  PID             |    02   | Alfanum  |     SIM     |
|   3   |  Serial Number   |    03   | Alfanum  |     SIM     |
|   4   |  DSK             |    04   | Alfanum  |     SIM     |
|   5   |  SC              |    05   | Alfanum  |             |
|   6   |  MAC1            |    06   | Alfanum  |             |
|   7   |  MAC2            |    07   | Alfanum  |             |
|-------------------------------------------------------------|
